  "description": "Unit-testing support for tik4net: write tests against RouterOS logic with no router involved. TikFakeConnection implements the same ITikConnection contract as a real transport, answers scripted rows through TikFakeReSentence / TikFakeDoneSentence / TikFakeTrapSentence, and records what was sent so a test can assert on it. Works at all three API levels, including the O/R mapper.",
